 "sentences": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 0.15,
   "speechStart": 0.15,
   "end": 4.7,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Before satellites, every ship crossed every ocean on one idea."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 4.95,
   "speechStart": 4.95,
   "end": 10.625,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "If I know where I started, which way I went, how fast, and for how long, I know where I am."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 10.875,
   "speechStart": 10.875,
   "end": 17.4,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "That’s dead reckoning, and it’s still on the exam, and it’s still what gets you home when the screen goes dark."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 17.65,
   "speechStart": 17.65,
   "end": 19.55,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "First, the symbols."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 19.8,
   "speechStart": 19.8,
   "end": 21.625,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Look at the diagram."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 21.875,
   "speechStart": 21.875,
   "end": 26.6,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "A fix, from two or more good lines of position, is a small circle."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 26.85,
   "speechStart": 26.85,
   "end": 32.6,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "A dead reckoning position, from course and speed alone, is a half circle on the course line."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 32.85,
   "speechStart": 32.85,
   "end": 39.1,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "An estimated position, which is a DR improved with other information, is a small square."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 39.35,
   "speechStart": 39.35,
   "end": 43.8,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "And an electronic fix, from GPS, is often a triangle."
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 44.05,
   "speechStart": 44.05,
   "end": 46.575,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Write the time beside every one."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 46.825,
   "speechStart": 47.575,
   "end": 51.3,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "So which do you trust more: the circle, or the half circle?"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 51.55,
   "speechStart": 51.55,
   "end": 53.075,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "The circle."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 53.325,
   "speechStart": 53.325,
   "end": 55.175,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "A fix is measured."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 55.425,
   "speechStart": 55.425,
   "end": 57.575,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "A DR is calculated."
  }
 ]
